<title>UK: J.Sainsbury sets $200 mln March 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>J.Sainsbury sets $200 mln March 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J. SAINSBURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    27.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.263   PAY DATE   S10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    99.688    SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.3 PCT   SELL CONC  1.575 PCT PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT NOV 2001 U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
